## What this project is

**{{projectName}}** is a cross-platform desktop application scaffolded with the
`dude` CLI (`tauri` stack).

| Layer     | Tech                                                              |
| --------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Targets   | Desktop (macOS/Windows/Linux) + Mobile (iOS/Android), one codebase|
| Frontend  | React 19 + Vite + TypeScript (strict) + Ant Design (antd 5)       |
| Backend   | Rust — Tauri 2 (commands, managed state, events, plugins)         |
| IPC       | Typed wrappers in `src/ipc/` ↔ `#[tauri::command]` modules        |
{{#if withSqlite}}
| Database  | SQLite via rusqlite (bundled), stored in the app-data directory   |
{{/if}}
| Tooling   | pnpm, prettier + ESLint (FE), cargo fmt + clippy (BE), MkDocs     |

